      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good high-level overview, but for my module, I really need specific script-style examples. Like, can you write out three short dialogue snippets? One where a hiring manager is interviewing someone with a thick accent or AAVE, and one where they are interviewing someone with a standard accent, so we can compare the \"vibe\" or the internal monologue of the manager. It'll help the trainees see the actual bias in action.",
